      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-11T06:32:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, and that\u0027s exactly my point. A malicious host may of course trigger this PnP issue, but it is no more than a DoS issue. If a malicious host wants to drain the battery, it can do that in lots of other ways, without even involving pVMs, anyway.",
      "parentUuid": "1d91a50c_9c9b1ded",
      "revId": "d9a8e6be9b1b7167c4422e129aef05ab4e7d6a63",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
